  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: an in-flight Send-Document on any connection\n     suppressed the submission timeout of every pending job.\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-107885.patch: give Create-Job jobs an\n       absolute MultipleOperationTimeout deadline in scheduler/ipp.c and\n       only defer the timeout in cupsdCheckJobs() until it passes.\n     - CVE-2026-107885\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: NULL dereference on repeated IPP group tags in\n     job-creation requests.\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-107890.patch: drop unnamed group-separator\n       attributes in add_job() and add_job_subscriptions() in\n       scheduler/ipp.c.\n     - CVE-2026-107890",
